THIRD-PARTY NOTICES FOR inside-llm
==================================

inside-llm is distributed under the MIT license (see LICENSE). Its release
packages also contain code from the third-party components listed below, each
under its own license. This file reproduces their notices and license texts,
as those licenses require.

There are four release packages, all for x86-64:

  inside-llm-v<version>-linux-cuda.tar.gz      NVIDIA GPUs (CUDA)
  inside-llm-v<version>-linux-vulkan.tar.gz    any GPU with a Vulkan driver
  inside-llm-v<version>-windows-cuda.zip       NVIDIA GPUs (CUDA)
  inside-llm-v<version>-windows-vulkan.zip     any GPU with a Vulkan driver

Each package holds the inside-llm executable (the engine, with the web
interface embedded in it) and, next to it, the runtime libraries listed
below. The "Used in" column says which packages carry each component; "all"
means all four.

The language models (GGUF files) that inside-llm loads or downloads are not
part of inside-llm. Each one is distributed by its authors under its own
license.


